//RS /// Run `body` on its own AST-pointer expression memo.
//RS ///
//RS /// The memo below is keyed by node identity alone, so it is only sound while
//RS /// one `LowerEnv` is in force. Two lowerings cross that line:
//RS ///
//RS ///   * comptime re-entry, which lowers under a different `Cx` (D-CTCACHE1); and
//RS ///   * a lambda body, which is lowered once per pass — the AOT closure text,
